; 2026-09-06, user explicit ("why is there still color rect rectangle on
; lantern glow") -- Bulb (a flat 28x28 ColorRect square) removed outright;
; it was a leftover placeholder from before any real art/glow existed,
; never converted, and showed as an obvious hard-edged rectangle under the
; soft radial Glow sprite. Glow alone reads as a light with no rectangle.
;
; 2026-09-06, user explicit ("add glow on lantern glow on the collision of
; it") -- Glow used to sit at Lantern's own origin (0,0), but the actual
; Hurtbox/CollisionShape2D was moved to (-96, 28) to line up with the
; copy-7 "lantern show" art's visible bulb. Moved here to match, so the
; glow visual actually sits where the hittable spot is instead of the old
; dead-center position.
[node name="Glow" type="Sprite2D" parent="Lantern" unique_id=-1289417182]
visible = false
position = Vector2(-96, 28)
z_index = 1
texture = SubResource("GradientTexture2D_lantern_glow")

